eye-contact-co-processing-at-the-speed-of-light-lines-9 = cons "## 6. Hard to Fake: Autonomic Leakage" (cons "" (cons "A structural asymmetry separates conscious and autonomic channels. Conscious speech is high-control and low-cost to mask: a speaker can map incompatible internal states to the exact same sentence. Autonomic optical signals—pupil diameter, rapid periocular micro-expressions, involuntary attentional capture, lacrimation, and periocular vascular tone—largely bypass deliberate cortical override." (cons "" (cons "In `neuro/eye-contact.hypercubical` (`Unfakeable`, `ec-conscious-mask-fails`), an autonomic observable invariant under conscious policy modulation strictly preserves internal-state distinctions that symbolic speech can erase. During eye contact, you observe the other person's nervous system partially unfiltered by conscious narrative control." (cons "" nil)))))
